Package: bubbros-native
Architecture: any
Depends: python3,
         python3-pygame,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Provides: bubbros
Conflicts: bubbros, bubbros-server-embedded, bubbros-play-alone
Replaces: bubbros, bubbros-server-embedded, bubbros-play-alone
Suggests: python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, default-jre
Recommends: pulseaudio-utils | pipewire-alsa | libasound2-plugins
Description: multiplayer Bubble Bobble clone (system Python, all clients)
 The Bub's Brothers is a fast multiplayer game for up to 10 players, on
 one computer or over the network, inspired by Bubble Bobble: blow
 bubbles to catch the monsters and burst them, collect the bonuses and
 survive the levels.  It includes a large set of levels and mini-games.
 .
 This package runs the game on the system's Python 3: the game server
 and web launcher (menu: "Bub-n-Bros server"), the Python client
 (pygame, GTK or X) and the native client, bubbros-native ("Bub-n-Bros
 play alone"), which plays alone with this server.

Package: bubbros-server-embedded
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Provides: bubbros
Conflicts: bubbros, bubbros-native, bubbros-play-alone
Replaces: bubbros, bubbros-native, bubbros-play-alone
Recommends: pulseaudio-utils | pipewire-alsa | libasound2-plugins
Description: multiplayer Bubble Bobble clone (server with its own Python)
 The Bub's Brothers is a fast multiplayer game for up to 10 players, on
 one computer or over the network, inspired by Bubble Bobble: blow
 bubbles to catch the monsters and burst them, collect the bonuses and
 survive the levels.  It includes a large set of levels and mini-games.
 .
 This package has the game server as one program with its own Python
 inside (built with PyInstaller): bubnbros-server, and its web launcher
 bubbros (menu: "Bub-n-Bros server"); and the native client,
 bubbros-native ("Bub-n-Bros play alone").

Package: bubbros-play-alone
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Provides: bubbros
Conflicts: bubbros, bubbros-native, bubbros-server-embedded
Replaces: bubbros, bubbros-native, bubbros-server-embedded
Recommends: pulseaudio-utils | pipewire-alsa | libasound2-plugins
Description: multiplayer Bubble Bobble clone (native client with a built-in server)
 The Bub's Brothers is a fast multiplayer game for up to 10 players, on
 one computer or over the network, inspired by Bubble Bobble: blow
 bubbles to catch the monsters and burst them, collect the bonuses and
 survive the levels.  It includes a large set of levels and mini-games.
 .
 This package is only the native client, bubbros-native, with the game
 server built in: one program that joins games on the network or, from
 the menu ("Bub-n-Bros play alone"), starts a game just for you.
